}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # List Monev Proposals
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/monev`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅  
  **Role Required:** Admin
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil daftar proposal",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "uuid-proposal",
        "judul": "Proposal Penelitian AI",
        "file_url": "/uploads/proposals/proposal.pdf",
        "status_usulan": "Disetujui",
        "members": [...],
        "substansiLuaran": [...]
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|--------|
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
  | 403 | Akses ditolak |
}
